{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1222711001:1":{"text":"约克逊，你看我们钓到了什么！","source_cn":"约克逊，你看我们钓到了什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2D194C2EB91A08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"黄金孔雀","source_cn":"黄金孔雀","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508EF0BB02A5AC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222711002:1":{"text":"艾雅女神显灵……这通体金黄的鱼身，这摇曳的长尾……真的是黄金孔雀！！","source_cn":"艾雅女神显灵……这通体金黄的鱼身，这摇曳的长尾……真的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E78A705BE67C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222711003:1":{"text":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","source_cn":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94B3ED915ADF2F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222711003":{"text":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","source_cn":"你们是怎么钓上它的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94B3ED915ADF2F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222711004:1":{"text":"听起来和我知道的线索差不多……就没有什么特别的地方吗？","source_cn":"听起来和我知道的线索差不多……就没有什么特别的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC04C83F0B8655822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222711005:0":{"text":"唔，我们没有使用金币作为鱼饵算不算？","source_cn":"唔，我们没有使用金币作为鱼饵算不算？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E8826463B1CF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222711006:0":{"text":"——什么？！你们只用了普通的鱼饵？！","source_cn":"——什么？！你们只用了普通的鱼饵？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF3463F797573BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222711007:1":{"text":"这和我了解的黄金孔雀的习性不太一样，渔夫们都说它只吃金币……","source_cn":"这和我了解的黄金孔雀的习性不太一样，渔夫们都说它只吃金币……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF10E429C05EBA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222711008:1":{"text":"不行，我得好好研究一下！否则就太对不起冬青学会的学者精神了！","source_cn":"不行，我得好好研究一下！否则就太对不起冬青学会的学者精神了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8C7ABBD3478F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222711009:1":{"text":"虽然有些冒昧，但我能不能借这条鱼一看？","source_cn":"虽然有些冒昧，但我能不能借这条鱼一看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD821FD5EBF078C","variant_status":"","male":"","fem